1
00:01:08,510 --> 00:01:12,940
[Faces Reborn]

2
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:15,970
[Episode 9]

3
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:19,730
Care for a dance?

4
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,789
No matter how badly
you've been hurt in love,

5
00:01:22,789 --> 00:01:24,870
I'll be here to protect you tonight.

6
00:01:34,270 --> 00:01:35,220
Zhao Xiao.

7
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:37,160
Every bit of pain I've suffered

8
