How are you feeling?

13
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,800
Haven't had too much to drink, have you?

14
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,630
I'm fine.

15
00:03:03,120 --> 00:03:04,180
I'll take you home.

16
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,350
I don't want to go home.

17
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,650
Then where do you want to go?

18
00:03:11,870 --> 00:03:12,800
I'll go with you.

19
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,360
I want to...

20
00:03:31,070 --> 00:03:31,710
Sorry.

21
00:03:31,710 --> 00:03:32,710
Are you all right?

22
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,340
Excuse me for a moment.

23
00:03:55,730 --> 00:03:56,470
Xu Jing,

24
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:58,440
