the master and madam's room?

34
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:44,120
There have been a lot more sasaeng fans
around the villa lately.

35
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:45,120
Madam told me

36
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:46,480
to go through their personal trash

37
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,600
before throwing it away.

38
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,470
Leave it to me.

39
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,400
All right.

40
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:02,300
[Lin Di'er] [Qiao]

41
00:06:14,200 --> 00:06:15,590
Let me see.

42
00:06:15,610 --> 00:06:16,920
Looks much better now.

43
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:19,950
The actress is pretty good.

44
00:06:19,950 --> 00:06:21,430
But the actor's gaze is a little...

45
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,790
Let me

46
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:23,720
check the rundown.

47
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:26,010
Director Xu, here's your coffee.

48
00:06:26,030 --> 00:06:26,950
It's still hot.

49
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,310
You shouldn't have gone to the trouble.

50
00:06:28,310 --> 00:06:29,960
Thanks to your support,

51
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,560
Zhao Xiao got the chance

52
