59
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,920
He looks great now,

60
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:57,950
even better than before.

61
00:06:58,750 --> 00:07:00,610
If I were representing the brand,

62
00:07:00,630 --> 00:07:01,690
I'd choose him too.

63
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:04,160
Zhao Xiao really has worked hard.

64
00:07:07,750 --> 00:07:08,870
What's wrong, Director Xu?

65
00:07:08,870 --> 00:07:10,120
Is it too hot or...

66
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,720
I'm sorry,

67
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,630
but I don't drink lattes.

68
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,030
I'm lactose intolerant.

69
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,040
I'm so sorry, Director Xu.

70
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,000
I had no idea.

71
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,120
I'll make sure it doesn't happen again.

72
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,850
-I'll get you another one right away.
-It's okay.

73
00:07:21,430 --> 00:07:22,890
How can you be so careless?

74
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:25,310
Don't you know
Director Xu doesn't drink lattes?

75
00:07:25,310 --> 00:07:26,920
You can't even
get a simple thing like this right.

76
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:27,750
I'm sorry, Ms. Chen.

77
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:29,070
I'll prepare a new one right away.

78
00:07:29,070 --> 00:07:29,830
Hurry up.

79
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,690
And

80
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:32,110
be more careful next time.

81
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:33,120
Don't make me worry
about every little thing.

82
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:33,800
Yes.

83
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:45,190
You need to clean up
that woman's mess

84
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:46,659
as soon as possible.

85
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:49,360
If she gets in Zhao Xiao's way,

86
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:51,950
all your efforts
will have been for nothing.

87
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:56,120
And

88
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,970
you know me.

89
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:01,270
I'm not a patient person.

90
00:08:01,820 --> 00:08:03,150
Don't worry, Di'er.

91
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:06,160
I won't let her ruin our plans.

92
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:09,120
Xiao only wanted her for her face.

93
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,800
You're the one he really...

94
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:12,070
I know that perfectly well.

95
00:08:12,070 --> 00:08:13,390
Zhao Xiao wouldn't be where he is today

96
00:08:13,390 --> 00:08:14,510
without me.

97
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,830
Everything he has

98
00:08:16,430 --> 00:08:17,920
should belong to me.

99
00:08:18,190 --> 00:08:19,320
Don't worry, Di'er.

100
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,640
In her current state, Lan

101
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,830
won't be able

102
00:08:23,310 --> 00:08:25,710
to cause us any trouble
even if she wakes up.

103
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:08,560
Tone it down with Xu Jing.

104
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:10,850
There are a lot of people watching you.

105
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:14,640
Weren't you the one
who told me to get close to her?

106
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:16,920
Xu Jing's connections are one thing,

107
00:09:17,030 --> 00:09:18,080
but you need to remember

108
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:19,940
who you can really count on.

109
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:22,910
You always need to know
where to draw the line.

110
00:09:23,170 --> 00:09:24,600
If Lin Di'er finds out

111
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:26,060
and causes another scene,

112
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:27,120
you're done for.

113
00:09:38,870 --> 00:09:39,600
Dr. He,

114
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,020
what are my chances

115
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,040
of getting my face back to the way it was?

116
00:09:44,040 --> 00:09:44,740
Mr. Zhao,

117
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,940
skin grafting is the only option.

118
00:09:47,060 --> 00:09:49,530
But human skin is very delicate,

119
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:51,730
and this will be a major undertaking.

120
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:55,050
I'm planning to take skin
from your inner thigh.

121
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:58,320
It's the closest match
to the skin on your face.

122
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,800
Will the grafted skin

123
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,030
be noticeable afterward?

124
00:10:03,050 --> 00:10:04,100
I'm afraid it will.

125
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:06,550
After all, it will be
from a different part of your body.

126
00:10:06,550 --> 00:10:07,550
But don't worry.

127
00:10:07,580 --> 00:10:10,510
At a normal social distance,
it won't be noticeable.

128
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,000
What about on camera?

129
00:10:20,850 --> 00:10:21,970
I want

130
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:24,870
a perfect match, 100 percent.

131
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:27,230
As if I'd had a whole new face.

132
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,120
Mr. Zhao,

133
00:10:28,410 --> 00:10:30,840
I can perform a full-body examination.

134
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,960
Using our hospital's patented equipment,

135
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:36,160
we can find the part of your body
best suited for the graft.

136
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:39,940
Dr. He,

137
00:10:41,630 --> 00:10:43,190
have you ever seen me act?

138
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:44,150
Of course.

139
00:10:45,030 --> 00:10:46,690
You were incredibly popular.

140
00:10:46,790 --> 00:10:49,580
Quite a few people around me
are your fans.

141
00:10:49,910 --> 00:10:50,720
Thank you.

142
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,910
I've always held myself

143
