has been for your own good.

183
00:12:43,700 --> 00:12:44,510
Of course.

184
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,880
And that is all the more reason for you
to remember your place.

185
00:13:06,910 --> 00:13:07,710
What's wrong?

186
00:13:09,890 --> 00:13:10,650
[The Cheating Scandal Unfolds]

187
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,220
See for yourself.

188
